\section{System Design}
\label{sec:design}

The architecture has two independent paths (Fig.~\ref{fig:architecture}). A background sweep runs every 60~s, reads sensors, scores each context, and updates which KV states are resident. The interaction path is triggered by user input: it picks the best resident state and decodes the intent.

